      "topic_id": "angles_polygon_interior_H",
      "prompt": "A polygon has 7 sides. 6 of its interior angles are each 124°, and the remaining interior angle is (4x + 88)°. Find x.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Sum of interior angles = (n - 2) × 180 = (7 - 2) × 180 = 900°",
        "Sum of the 6 equal angles = 6 × 124 = 744°",
        "Remaining angle = 900 - 744 = 156°",
        "4x + 88 = 156",
        "Subtract 88 from both sides:",
        "4x = 68",
        "Divide both sides by 4:",
        "x = 17"
      ],
      "final_answer": "17",
      "marks": 5,
      "mark_scheme": [
        {
